meta {
  name: Station Weather API
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  The public Station Weather API (`app.weather_main:app`), served by the `wps-weather-api-{SUFFIX}`
  service and published through the APS Kong gateway at `/api/weather/v1`. Send
  `Accept: text/csv` for CSV instead of JSON.

  Environments:
  - `local`: copy `local.sample.bru` to `local.bru` (git-ignored) and run
    `uv run uvicorn app.weather_main:app --port 8080` from `backend/packages/wps-api`.
  - `dev`: port-forward to a PR's service, which needs no API key (the gateway checks keys,
    the app does not): `oc -n e1e498-dev port-forward svc/wps-weather-api-pr-6073 8081:80`.
    Change the PR number to match.
  - `gateway`: through the test APS gateway. Set `API_BASE_URL` to the gateway host and the
    `API_KEY` secret to a key from the test API Services Portal.
}
